/*
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * TVASTRA PRODUCT TEMPLATE — CLEAN RESET
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 * Product Information is intentionally kept as one canonical
 * main-product section so the Shopify theme editor can register
 * and display the section reliably.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------
 */
{
